                "title": "Sleek Brass Leverset with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Omnia made 171S/00 is a Sleek Brass Leverset made out of solid brass. It is contemporary in design, pairing a modern shape with your choice of one of the modern finishes. The shape of the lever is not only stylish, it is also comfortable to your hand--making it one of the best choices if you are looking to add contemporary elegance that is both beautiful and functional to your home. The Sleek Solid Brass Lever is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions.\r\n",
